  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n## What Is The Recovery Time For Dental Implants?\n\n\nMay 19, 2022\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nShare on facebook\n\nShare on linkedin\n\nShare on twitter\n\nShare on email\n\nInterested in getting a brand-new smile? Then dental implants may be a great option for you. Dental implants are a great way to achieve a beautiful smile if you are experiencing any issues with your teeth in Los Angeles, CA, including damaged or missing teeth.\n\nDental implants can help improve or enhance your look and give you a renewed sense of self-confidence with a new set of pearly whites! Plus, in most cases, dental implants can be installed by a dentist in one day with very minimal recovery time. In fact, most patients can return to daily activities –including work and school – the very next day! Check out more information about dental implant recovery here and see how a dentist can help you achieve your best smile!\n\n\n## How Is The Dental Implant Process Performed?\n\n\nDental implants can often be placed in one day using advanced technology and proper planning for each patient, ensuring a customized restoration option is available and supplied to each patient.\n\nPre-planning technology allows dentists to precisely analyze your smile and plan a specific treatment route for you to make sure your new smile is the perfect match; specifically designing your new implants based on the original analysis. This planning occurs before placing the new dental implants and can include full arch dental implants, all on four to six dental implants, or individual implant placements.\n\nOnce the implants are placed with the first round of temporary restorations placed on top to give you an immediate smile makeover, your customized implants that are created in a dental lab are placed, replacing the temporaries as final dental implant restorations.\n\nThe recovery time following dental implant placement is typically around 4 to 6 months. However, your implant dentist will determine just how much time would be necessary for recovery, with most cases needing very minimal time off. Therefore, it is important to choose the best dental professional to execute these extraordinary restoration techniques to ensure your recovery time is small and your new smile is big and bright!\n\n\n## Are You Looking For A Dental Implant Expert?\n\n\nYour beautiful new smile awaits you with dental implants! Receive a new smile with minimal downtime today by calling our doctor, Dr. Tony Barriere, in our office by our office by Los Angeles, CA, to schedule your consultation today!\n\nPrevPreviousMethods Of Replacing Missing Teeth In Los Angeles, CA!\n\nNextDo You Need Sedation For Dental Implants?Next\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Are There Factors That Determine Which Type Of Dental Implant Procedure I Can Get Treated With?\n\n\nDental implants in Los Angeles, FL, are a safe and effective way to replace missing or damaged teeth. They are\n\nRead More »\n\nAugust 20, 2023\n\n\n### Does Anything Happen To My Jawbone If I Don’t Immediately Replace My Missing Teeth With Dental Implants?\n\n\nDental implants in Los Angeles, FL, are a gold standard tooth replacement option that are surgically placed in a patient’s\n\nAugust 14, 2023\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nCall Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
